{"timestamp":"2026-08-16T01:09:56.901Z","ordinal":19125,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019ffe5b-1054-7c22-8afc-e97cb84c7b73","turn_id":"01a007af-dc2d-7273-a829-7d59e29dc4f8","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_00fb20eee1c75140016a810de376ac8198be9fe0f82119236e","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The executable column is fully green, but verification found four genuine test-selection gaps: concurrency locking, refund/cancellation integrity, three migration relationships, and two retry-action fail-safe branches plus Stripe status mapping. I’m addressing all four in one bounded test hardening pass, then I’ll mutate those exact mechanisms and re-hand the final tree once."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1786842595505,"completed_at_ms":1786842596901}}
