iled durable refund (106 ms)\\n      ✓ keeps the raised contrast on the status and the seat line (30 ms)\\n      ✓ keeps the raised contrast on a cancelled status (41 ms)\\n      ✓ lets a keyboard reach the sideways-scrolling bookings region (49 ms)\\n      ✓ names the leg the airline cancelled, not whichever came first (28 ms)\\n      ✓ says the seat is held and the refund is whole (30 ms)\\n      ✓ keeps the seat change available while another leg still flies (116 ms)\\n      ✓ stops promising a refund once the flight has gone (31 ms)\\n      ✓ marks a released seat rather than printing the seat somebody else may now hold (22 ms)\\n\\nTest Suites: 1 passed, 1 total\\nTests:       33 passed, 33 total\\nSnapshots:   0 total\\nTime:        10.921 s\\nRan all test suites matching /ProfileClient/i.\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a007af-dc2d-7273-a829-7d59e29dc4f8"}}}
