{"timestamp":"2026-08-16T02:44:42.912Z","ordinal":20678,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a00875-0920-7d60-b145-cb04c3e31074","author":"/root/ui_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/ui_review\nPayload:\nThrowaway Playwright fallback used because browser-plugin tooling was unavailable.\n\nBlocking finding:\n\n- The receipt’s “Payment date” is not the capture date. [app/profile/page.tsx](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/app/profile/page.tsx:89) selects `PaymentAttempt.createdAt`, maps it to `paidAt` at line 138, and [ProfileClient.tsx](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/components/ui/ProfileClient.tsx:730) labels it “Payment date.” An authorization whose capture succeeds later—including the supported capture-retry path—can therefore show the wrong calendar date. The immediate live journey displayed August 16 correctly, but it does not constrain delayed capture.\n\nEverything else passed at 390×844, 768×1024, and 1440×900:\n\n- Exact `Paid $1,200 USD`, date, and flight MA304 rendered under “Payment history.”\n- Articles had exact accessible names `Receipt for booking <id>`.\n- Cancellation updated the same receipt to exact `$960 USD refunded`.\n- A separately linked `AUTHORIZED` booking produced no receipt.\n- Provider intent, checkout/idempotency, attempt, and fingerprint values and terminology were absent.\n- Receipt hierarchy and contrast were clear; cards remained within the viewport.\n- Document/client/body widths matched at every viewport before and after refund.\n- No console errors, page errors, request failures, or HTTP 500s.\n- One pre-existing Recharts zero-size warning appeared intermittently on the desktop profile; it is outside this receipt slice.\n\nScreenshots:\n\n- [Phone captured](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-receipt-phone-390x844-captured.png)\n- [Phone refunded](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-receipt-phone-390x844-refunded.png)\n- [Tablet captured](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-receipt-tablet-768x1024-captured.png)\n- [Tablet refunded](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-receipt-tablet-768x1024-refunded.png)\n- [Desktop captured](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-receipt-desktop-1440x900-captured.png)\n- [Desktop refunded](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-receipt-desktop-1440x900-refunded.png)\n\nCleanup/integrity: review users, bookings, attempts, notifications, and holds are all zero; port 3000 is free. Git remains exactly the intended five modified plus one untracked paths, with no staged or committed diff."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a007af-dc2d-7273-a829-7d59e29dc4f8"}}}
