{"timestamp":"2026-08-16T03:15:13.135Z","ordinal":21098,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a00890-f66f-7210-8576-eb353f2cdd5d","call_id":"call_oQvngFi2ykVsyEpYMtdNUy3y","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/ui_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Throwaway Playwright fallback used because browser-plugin tooling was unavailable.\\n\\nNo actionable findings.\\n\\nThe fixed capture-date behavior passed at 390×844, 768×1024, and 1440×900:\\n\\n- Each payment was captured through the real guarded checkout flow.\\n- Its `createdAt` was then set to August 14 while immutable `capturedAt` remained August 16.\\n- Every receipt displayed `Payment date August 16, 2026` and did not display August 14.\\n- Exact `Paid $1,200 USD`, MA304, and accessible article name `Receipt for booking <id>` passed.\\n- A linked `AUTHORIZED` attempt/booking rendered no receipt; exactly one captured receipt remained.\\n- Cancellation updated the receipt to exact `$960 USD refunded`.\\n- No provider intent, attempt, checkout/idempotency, or fingerprint values/terminology reached rendered text.\\n- Receipt hierarchy, contrast, accessible section heading/article names, and cancellation live status remained clear. The receipt adds no interactive keyboard target.\\n- All document/client/body widths matched their viewports before and after refund; cards stayed within bounds.\\n- No console errors, page errors, request failures, or HTTP 500s occurred. The known pre-existing Recharts zero-size warning appeared twice on phone only and is unrelated to this slice.\\n\\nScreenshots:\\n\\n- [Phone captured](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-receipt-phone-390x844-captured.png)\\n- [Phone refunded](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-receipt-phone-390x844-refunded.png)\\n- [Tablet captured](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-receipt-tablet-768x1024-captured.png)\\n- [Tablet refunded](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-receipt-tablet-768x1024-refunded.png)\\n- [Desktop captured](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-receipt-desktop-1440x900-captured.png)\\n- [Desktop refunded](/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/test-results/ui-review/issue75-receipt-desktop-1440x900-refunded.png)\\n\\nCleanup/integrity: review users, bookings, attempts, notifications, and holds are all zero; port 3000 is free. Git remains exactly nine intended modified and two intended untracked paths, with no staged or committed branch diff.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/verifier\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a007af-dc2d-7273-a829-7d59e29dc4f8"}}}
