{"timestamp":"2026-08-16T03:33:27.046Z","ordinal":21267,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a008a1-a785-72d2-b333-af0e4607c7ea","author":"/root/verifier","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/verifier\nPayload:\nFinal verifier re-hand: no actionable findings remain.\n\nResults:\n\n- Prisma generation: passed; `.next` cleared afterward.\n- TypeScript: passed.\n- Lint: 0 errors, same 8 baseline warnings.\n- Unit: 70 suites, 812/812 passed.\n- Fresh migration: all 42 migrations deployed.\n- Focused fresh integrity proof: 10/10 passed.\n- Populated migration: passed. Historical CAPTURED `capturedAt` exactly matched its prior `updatedAt`; 1,415 flights and 10 airports remained; one trigger and one constraint were installed.\n- Full database: 31 suites, 203/203 passed.\n- Build: passed; sanitizer removed one standalone `.env`.\n- Full serial Playwright: 40/40 passed in 5.1 minutes with clean teardown.\n\nMutation audit:\n\n- Rows 1–11 remain directly and non-vacuously constrained.\n- Row 12 is valid: removing `INSERT` from the trigger causes the direct CAPTURED/null insertion to violate `PaymentAttempt_captured_has_time`; the test requires a trigger-stamped `Date`.\n- Row 13 is valid: deleting the historical UPDATE makes the executable migration probe fail before execution, while the restored probe additionally verifies exact `updatedAt` backfill and leaves AUTHORIZED rows null.\n- All 13 reported mutants are restored and the selection now covers both prior gaps. No additional uncovered changed behavior found.\n\nClassification:\n\n- Unit increased from the 808-test baseline to 812 with no regression.\n- React `act(...)`, expected database-constraint logs, and `NO_COLOR` warnings were non-failing known noise.\n- Playwright emitted two non-failing `ECONNRESET/aborted` server messages. No test failed or required retry; the same runtime-noise class appeared in the prior pass and is unrelated to the test-only re-hand.\n- No clean-main DB/build/Playwright baseline exists, as stated.\n\nSkips:\n\n- Dependency audit: package files unchanged.\n- Container scan: Dockerfile, standalone, and sanitizer paths unchanged.\n- UI re-review: test-only finding fixes cannot alter the already-reviewed rendered output.\n\nIntegrity:\n\n- Exact intended status remains 9 modified plus 2 untracked files.\n- No staged or committed branch diff; `HEAD == main == bb599585`.\n- `git diff --check` clean.\n- `.next`, temporary Prisma copy, and both verifier scratch databases removed.\n- No matching verifier or mutant scratch databases remain.\n- Port 3000 is free.\n- PostgreSQL and Mailpit remain healthy.\n- No tracked/status-reported file was changed by verification.\n\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a007af-dc2d-7273-a829-7d59e29dc4f8"}}}
