2026-07-13T14-30-52-019f5d63-d808-77f2-8f4c-7d1415c91a7c.jsonl, updated_at=2026-07-27T00:39:09+00:00, thread_id=019f5d63-d808-77f2-8f4c-7d1415c91a7c, point-in-time roadmap state)\n\n### keywords\n\n- P1.2, Model round trips correctly, outbound, inbound, combined itinerary summary, airport-local date rules, degraded-service states, REAL_WORLD_ROADMAP.md\n\n## User preferences\n\n- When selecting work, the user asked to pull latest code and inspect the roadmap before deciding what to do -> inspect Git state, repository guidance, `REAL_WORLD_ROADMAP.md`, recent commits, and open PRs before editing. [Task 1]\n- The user expects the repository workflow to be followed, including subagents and verification -> run UI review, verifier, and code review before commit. [Task 1]\n\n## Reusable knowledge\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"# Task Group: Travel-app repository workflow and roadmap triage\n\nscope: Choosing and delivering the next `/travel-app` roadmap work; use before edits or merges in this checkout.\napplies_to: cwd=/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app; reuse_rule=checkout-specific: revalidate roadmap, Git state, commits, and open PRs because priorities and merge state change\n\n## Task 1: Inspect the roadmap and repository workflow before choosing work\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app, rollout_path=/home/scottdensmore/.codex/sessions/2026/07/13/rollout-2026-07-13T14-30-52-019f5d63-d808-77f2-8f4c-7d1415c91a7c.jsonl, updated_at=2026-07-27T00:39:09+00:00, thread_id=019f5d63-d808-77f2-8f4c-7d1415c91a7c, validated roadmap triage and PR merges)\n\n### keywords\n\n- travel-app, .agents/AGENTS.md, REAL_WORLD_ROADMAP.md, origin/main, gh pr merge, PR #40, P0.5, P1.1, P1.2, signed Conventional Commits, squash merge\n\n## Task 2: Identify the next roadmap item after P1.1 search retry delivery\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app, rollout_path=/home/scottdensmore/.codex/sessions/2026/07/13/rollout-2026-07-13T14-30-52-019f5d63-d808-77f2-8f4c-7d1415c91a7c.jsonl, updated_at=2026-07-27T00:39:09+00:00, thread_id=019f5d63-d808-77f2-8f4c-7d1415c91a7c, point-in-time roadmap state)\n\n### keywords\n\n- P1.2, Model round trips correctly, outbound, inbound, combined itinerary summary, airport-local date rules, degraded-service states, REAL_WORLD_ROADMAP.md\n\n## User preferences\n\n- When selecting work, the user asked to pull latest code and inspect the roadmap before deciding what to do -> inspect Git state, repository guidance, `REAL_WORLD_ROADMAP.md`, recent commits, and open PRs before editing. [Task 1]\n- The user expects the repository workflow to be followed, including subagents and verification -> run UI review, verifier, and code review before commit. [Task 1]\n\n## Reusable knowledge\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":9580},"formatted_output":"# Task Group: Travel-app repository workflow and roadmap triage\n\nscope: Choosing and delivering the next `/travel-app` roadmap work; use before edits or merges in this checkout.\napplies_to: cwd=/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app; reuse_rule=checkout-specific: revalidate roadmap, Git state, commits, and open PRs because priorities and merge state change\n\n## Task 1: Inspect the roadmap and repository workflow before choosing work\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app, rollout_path=/home/scottdensmore/.codex/sessions/2026/07/13/rollout-2026-07-13T14-30-52-019f5d63-d808-77f2-8f4c-7d1415c91a7c.jsonl, updated_at=2026-07-27T00:39:09+00:00, thread_id=019f5d63-d808-77f2-8f4c-7d1415c91a7c, validated roadmap triage and PR merges)\n\n### keywords\n\n- travel-app, .agents/AGENTS.md, REAL_WORLD_ROADMAP.md, origin/main, gh pr merge, PR #40, P0.5, P1.1, P1.2, signed Conventional Commits, squash merge