{"timestamp":"2026-08-16T04:28:43.201Z","ordinal":21911,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_00fb20eee1c75140016a813c772d088198a0fe7fd40bdcc329","status":"completed","call_id":"call_zHiwz6QDjFa9N7atQqhDmyma","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({\n  cmd: \"gh pr list --state open --json number,title,headRefName,baseRefName,isDraft,url && gh issue view 75 --json number,title,state,body,comments,labels,milestone,url && gh issue list --state open --limit 100 --search 'repo:scottdensmore/travel-app (payment OR stripe OR reconciliation OR refund)' --json number,title,labels,milestone,url\",\n  workdir: \"/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app\",\n  yield_time_ms: 30000,\n  max_output_tokens: 30000,\n  sandbox_permissions: \"require_escalated\",\n  justification: \"Allow reading the live open PR and payment-related issue state to scope the next #75 slice?\",\n  prefix_rule: [\"gh\", \"issue\", \"list\"]\n});\ntext(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a008d3-a8d1-70b1-a975-44bf5aea121d"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-16T04:28:49.014Z","ordinal":21912,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019ffe5b-1054-7c22-8afc-e97cb84c7b73","turn_id":"01a008d3-a8d1-70b1-a975-44bf5aea121d","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-bc17bbca-26ab-4dac-8e7c-f483e8b46fa0","process_id":"41616","command":["/bin/bash","-lc","gh pr list --state open --json number,title,headRefName,baseRefName,isDraft,url && gh issue view 75 --json number,title,state,body,comments,labels,milestone,url && gh issue list --state open --limit 100 --search 'repo:scottdensmore/travel-app (payment OR stripe OR reconciliation OR refund)' --json number,title,labels,milestone,url"],"cwd":"file:///home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr list --state open --json number,title,headRefName,baseRefName,isDraft,url && gh issue view 75 --json number,title,state,body,comments,labels,milestone,url && gh issue list --state open --limit 100 --search 'repo:scottdensmore/travel-app (payment OR stripe OR reconciliation OR refund)' --json number,title,labels,milestone,url"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"[]\n{\"body\":\"Migrated from `REAL_WORLD_ROADMAP.md`.\\n\\n## Tasks\\n\\n- [ ] Select a payment provider and use hosted/tokenized card components.\\n- [ ] Ensure the application never receives or stores raw card numbers or CVVs.\\n- [ ] Add authorization, capture, failure, retry, refund, and reconciliation states.\\n- [ ] Verify signed webhooks and handle duplicate/out-of-order delivery.\\n- [ ] Add receipts and customer-safe payment history.\\n\\n## Acceptance criteria\\n\\n- A booking is confirmed only after the required payment state is established.\\n- Webhook handling is idempotent and tested.\\n- No raw payment-card data appears in application state, requests, logs, or the database.\\n\",\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOOKAPdM8AAAABO-mzuw\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"scottdensmore\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"PR #276 merged the first independently shippable payment slice:\\n\\n- authenticated, strict server action for starting checkout payment\\n- server-authoritative itinerary pricing and live seat/cabin validation\\n- durable PaymentAttempt metadata and stable Stripe idempotency\\n- manual-capture PaymentIntent creation without storing raw card data or client secrets\\n- migration constraints, reconciliation retention, leak tracking, and focused coverage\\n\\nRemaining for #75:\\n\\n- render Stripe Elements and confirm the PaymentIntent\\n- gate booking creation on authoritative payment state and capture\\n- signed, idempotent webhook processing for duplicate/out-of-order delivery\\n- cancellation, retry, refund, and reconciliation workflows\\n- receipts and customer-safe payment history\\n\\nThe issue remains open for those later slices.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T02:43:35Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/scottdensmore/travel-app/issues/75#issuecomment-5300138939\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOOKAPdM8AAAABPCSPSQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"scottdensmore\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"PR #279 merged the fourth independently shippable payment slice. The merged #75 work now includes:\\n\\n- #276 — durable, idempotent server-side Stripe authorization with server-authoritative pricing and no raw card data\\n- #277 — signed, idempotent webhook reconciliation for duplicate and out-of-order delivery\\n- #278 — hosted Stripe payment fields and checkout authorization without application-owned card entry\\n- #279 — booking-to-PaymentIntent linkage, exact idempotent capture, abandoned-authorization cancellation, interrupted-response recovery, and truthful retry UI that does not authorize twice\\n\\nRemaining for #75:\\n\\n- refund workflows and their failure/retry states\\n- receipts and customer-safe payment history\\n- any broader operational reconciliation/retry tooling needed beyond the durable webhook and capture recovery paths already merged\\n\\nThe issue remains open for those later slices.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T20:03:01Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/scottdensmore/travel-app/issues/75#issuecomment-5303996233\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOOKAPdM8AAAABPDhxSg\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"scottdensmore\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"PR #281 merged the cancellation-refund slice. The merged #75 work now includes:\\n\\n- durable refunds linked to immutable cancellation history and the exact policy-decided amount\\n- Stripe refund idempotency, lost-response recovery, retry attempts, and concurrency-safe state persistence\\n- customer-safe refund status on the profile page with accessible failure and keyboard retry recovery\\n- database constraints, migration proofs, provider mapping, leak tracking, and paid cancellation journey coverage\\n\\nRemaining for #75:\\n\\n- receipts and customer-safe payment history\\n- any broader operational reconciliation/retry tooling needed beyond the durable webhook, capture, and refund recovery paths already merged\\n\\nThe issue remains open for those later slices.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-16T02:17:10Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/scottdensmore/travel-app/issues/75#issuecomment-5305299274\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOOKAPdM8AAAABPD6hcA\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"scottdensmore\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"PR #282 merged the customer payment-history slice. The merged #75 work now also includes:\\n\\n- customer-safe receipts on the profile for captured bookings, including amount, payment date, itinerary flights, and durable refund outcome\\n- server-side projection that excludes provider intent, checkout, idempotency, fingerprint, and internal payment-attempt identifiers\\n- an immutable database-owned capture timestamp with historical backfill, forged-time rejection, and captured-state downgrade protection\\n- responsive and accessible receipt coverage across phone, tablet, and desktop, plus the paid cancellation/refund journey\\n\\nThe original hosted-payment, card-data, authorization/capture, signed-webhook, refund, retry, and customer-history outcomes are now represented by merged slices #276 through #282.\\n\\nRemaining for #75:\\n\\n- decide and deliver any broader staff-facing operational reconciliation/retry tooling needed beyond the durable webhook, capture, and refund recovery paths already merged\\n\\nThe issue remains open for that explicitly scoped follow-up.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-16T04:24:00Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/scottdensmore/travel-app/issues/75#issuecomment-5305704816\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true}],\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOOKAPdM8AAAACtc5f4A\",\"name\":\"roadmap\",\"description\":\"Product hardening work migrated from REAL_WORLD_ROADMAP.md\",\"color\":\"5319e7\"}],\"milestone\":{\"number\":3,\"title\":\"Phase 2\",\"description\":\"Real booking lifecycle: replace demo booking and payment behavior with explicit, auditable domain workflows.\",\"dueOn\":null},\"number\":75,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"P2.3 Integrate real payments safely\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/scottdensmore/travel-app/issues/75\"}\n[{\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOOKAPdM8AAAACtc5f4A\",\"name\":\"roadmap\",\"description\":\"Product hardening work migrated from REAL_WORLD_ROADMAP.md\",\"color\":\"5319e7\"}],\"milestone\":{\"number\":3,\"title\":\"Phase 2\",\"description\":\"Real booking lifecycle: replace demo booking and payment behavior with explicit, auditable domain workflows.\",\"dueOn\":null},\"number\":75,\"title\":\"P2.3 Integrate real payme