n        ✓ normalizes seat patterns before persisting occurrences (4 ms)\n        ✓ reports existing occurrences as updated (3 ms)\n        ✓ applies the requested layout after a concurrent occurrence create (3 ms)\n        ✓ rejects malformed or excessive occurrence date ranges (2 ms)\n        ✓ does not invalidate seats already assigned to passengers (4 ms)\n        ✓ does not move an occupied seat across cabin boundaries (5 ms)\n  getOccupiedSeatsAction authorization\n    ✓ refuses an unauthenticated caller, without reaching the database (1 ms)\n    ✓ refuses a session carrying no user id\n    ✓ answers any signed-in traveller, for any flight (1 ms)\n    ✓ still validates the flight id for a signed-in caller (7 ms)\n    ✓ answers who is asking before what they asked for (1 ms)\n  holdChosenSeatsAction input boundary\n    ✓ rejects a malformed checkout identifier before writing a hold (3 ms)\n    ✓ propagates an unexpected hold storage failure (2 ms)\n\nTest Suites: 1 passed, 1 total\nTests:       111 passed, 111 total\nSnapshots:   0 total\nTime:        3.482 s\nRan all test suites matching /__tests__\\/app\\/actions.test.ts/i.\n\n> travel-app@0.1.0 test:unit\n> npx jest --selectProjects unit --silent\n\nRunning one project: unit\nPASS unit __tests__/app/adminPaymentsPage.test.tsx\nPASS unit __tests__/lib/authEmailRequest.test.ts\nPASS unit __tests__/lib/FlightBookingService.test.ts\nPASS unit __tests__/app/api/stripeWebhook.test.ts\nPASS unit __tests__/lib/validation.test.ts\nPASS unit __tests__/app/api/authTokenConfirmation.test.ts\nPASS unit __tests__/lib/cabinClass.test.ts\nPASS unit __tests__/lib/seatHolds.test.ts\nPASS unit __tests__/instrumentation.test.ts\nPASS unit __tests__/lib/passengerDataRotation.test.ts\nPASS unit __tests__/lib/stripeWebhook.test.ts\nPASS unit __tests__/lib/staffMfa.test.ts\nPASS unit __tests__/lib/stripePaymentProvider.test.ts\nPASS unit __tests__/lib/flightStatus.test.ts\nPASS unit __tests__/security/prismaLogging.test.ts\nPASS un