{"timestamp":"2026-08-16T05:40:49.686Z","ordinal":23210,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019ffe5b-1054-7c22-8afc-e97cb84c7b73","turn_id":"01a008d3-a8d1-70b1-a975-44bf5aea121d","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_00fb20eee1c75140016a814d5f88d88198a7c4fd5e779493f3","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Expert review is clean. The admin layout enforces verified MFA before rendering, the action repeats that authorization before constructing Stripe, the queue is bounded and DB-clock based, reconciliation shares the same PaymentIntent advisory lock as checkout/webhooks, and the UI exposes safe pending/success/error semantics without inventing webhook events. The live issue confirms this is the explicitly remaining staff operational-reconciliation outcome, so this slice should complete #75."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1786858847573,"completed_at_ms":1786858849686}}
