{"timestamp":"2026-08-16T05:54:19.521Z","ordinal":23483,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019ffe5b-1054-7c22-8afc-e97cb84c7b73","turn_id":"01a008d3-a8d1-70b1-a975-44bf5aea121d","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_00fb20eee1c75140016a81508711948198a6226a60c0267513","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"PR [#283](https://github.com/scottdensmore/travel-app/pull/283) is merged, completing and closing [issue #75](https://github.com/scottdensmore/travel-app/issues/75).\n\nDelivered:\n\n- Verified-staff payment recovery queue\n- Concurrency-safe Stripe status reconciliation\n- Accessible responsive recovery feedback\n- Unit, database race/selection, and Playwright coverage\n- 29 mutation checks\n\nCI passed completely. No review threads remained. Squash commit: `931a331`.\n\nLocal `main` is clean and synchronized with `origin/main`; the feature branch was deleted and pruned. Live GitHub triage confirmed this was the remaining #75 operational tooling, with no duplicate work.\n\n"}],"phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":{"entries":[{"path":"MEMORY.md","lineStart":595,"lineEnd":625,"note":"repository workflow and roadmap selection guidance"}],"rolloutIds":["019f5d63-d808-77f2-8f4c-7d1415c91a7c"]}},"started_at_ms":1786859655103,"completed_at_ms":1786859659520}}
