{"timestamp":"2026-08-16T17:59:16.791Z","ordinal":23686,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019ffe5b-1054-7c22-8afc-e97cb84c7b73","turn_id":"01a00bba-29dd-7100-8715-811d18e7c7e1","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_00fb20eee1c75140016a81fa734b4c8198817accb8b8c2b54e","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I’m starting only slice 1: the behavior-neutral itinerary-versioning foundation. It will preserve current journeys while introducing immutable superseded legs and rebooking audit structure; the customer-facing rebooking flow stays for the next PR. I’ll take the required clean-`main` baseline, branch, then work test-first."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1786903155363,"completed_at_ms":1786903156791}}
