{"timestamp":"2026-08-16T18:59:07.865Z","ordinal":25205,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019ffe5b-1054-7c22-8afc-e97cb84c7b73","turn_id":"01a00bba-29dd-7100-8715-811d18e7c7e1","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_00fb20eee1c75140016a82087984208198951f0893d364c7bd","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"UI behavior passed completely, but the reviewer caught a real cleanup regression that the `.delete()` test missed: Prisma’s `deleteMany({ id })` hits the immediate leg-mapping foreign key on a freshly migrated database. I’m changing the old/new-leg references to cascade with the leg, while the deferred “booking must be gone” guard continues to reject direct leg deletion. I’ll add both exact query-shape regressions, then re-hand the final tree once."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1786906745546,"completed_at_ms":1786906747865}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-16T18:59:07.869Z","ordinal":25206,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_00fb20eee1c75140016a82087984208198951f0893d364c7bd","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"UI behavior passed completely, but the reviewer caught a real cleanup regression that the `.delete()` test missed: Prisma’s `deleteMany({ id })` hits the immediate leg-mapping foreign key on a freshly migrated database. I’m changing the old/new-leg references to cascade with the leg, while the deferred “booking must be gone” guard continues to reject direct leg deletion. I’ll add both exact query-shape regressions, then re-hand the final tree once."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a00bba-29dd-7100-8715-811d18e7c7e1"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-16T18:59:18.685Z","ordinal":25207,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_00fb20eee1c75140016a82087bd2e08198b771e61f91b9f382","status":"completed","call_id":"call_CIwcpfc81418zCOFRgcAOSvs","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/prisma/migrations/20260816181000_version_itinerary_legs/migration.sql\\n@@\\n     ADD CONSTRAINT \\\"BookingRebookingLeg_fromLegId_fkey\\\"\\n         FOREIGN KEY (\\\"fromLegId\\\") REFERENCES \\\"ItineraryLeg\\\"(\\\"id\\\")\\n-        ON DELETE NO ACTION ON UPDATE CASCADE,\\n+        ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\\n     ADD CONSTRAINT \\\"BookingRebookingLeg_toLegId_fkey\\\"\\n         FOREIGN KEY (\\\"toLegId\\\") REFERENCES \\\"ItineraryLeg\\\"(\\\"id\\\")\\n-        ON DELETE NO ACTION ON UPDATE CASCADE;\\n+        ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE;\\n*** Update File: /home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/prisma/schema.prisma\\n@@\\n-  providerIntentId     String?               @unique\\n+  providerIntentId     String?              @unique\\n@@\\n-  fromLeg     ItineraryLeg     @relation(\\\"RebookingFromLeg\\\", fields: [fromLegId], references: [id], onDelete: NoAction)\\n+  fromLeg     ItineraryLeg     @relation(\\\"RebookingFromLeg\\\", fields: [fromLegId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\\n@@\\n-  toLeg       ItineraryLeg     @relation(\\\"RebookingToLeg\\\", fields: [toLegId], references: [id], onDelete: NoAction)\\n+  toLeg       ItineraryLeg     @relation(\\\"RebookingToLeg\\\", fields: [toLegId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\\n*** Update File: /home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/__tests__/lib/itineraryRebooking.database.test.ts\\n@@\\n     it('refuses to delete a leg while its booking still exists', async () => {\\n@@\\n         })).toBe(1);\\n     });\\n+\\n+    it('does not let a cascading leg delete erase its rebooking mapping', async () => {\\n+        const saved = await recordRebooking();\\n+\\n+        await expect(prisma.itineraryLeg.delete({\\n+            where: { id: saved.oldLeg.id },\\n+        })).rejects.toThrow(/cannot be deleted while booking/);\\n+\\n+        expect(await prisma.bookingRebookingLeg.count({\\n+            where: { rebookingId: saved.rebookingId },\\n+        })).toBe(1);\\n+    });\\n@@\\n-        await prisma.booking.delete({ where: { id: saved.booking.id } });\\n+        expect(await prisma.booking.deleteMany({\\n+            where: { id: saved.booking.id },\\n+        })).toEqual({ count: 1 });\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a00bba-29dd-7100-8715-811d18e7c7e1"}}}
