{"timestamp":"2026-08-16T19:31:49.923Z","ordinal":25657,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_00fb20eee1c75140016a821022dd648198a98653f66dfc3963","status":"completed","call_id":"call_BDyk9UA8vBYKFI7FXB1S1aLp","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app/prisma/migrations/20260816181000_version_itinerary_legs/migration.sql\\n@@\\n--- Both legs remain real rows. The old one must already be historical, the new\\n--- one current, and both must occupy the same position in this booking.\\n+-- Both legs remain real rows. The destination must be current and both must\\n+-- occupy the same position in this booking. Because the legs differ and the\\n+-- partial unique index permits only one current row at that position, a current\\n+-- destination also proves the source is historical.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a00bba-29dd-7100-8715-811d18e7c7e1"}}}
