{"timestamp":"2026-08-16T19:53:20.719Z","ordinal":25985,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019ffe5b-1054-7c22-8afc-e97cb84c7b73","turn_id":"01a00bba-29dd-7100-8715-811d18e7c7e1","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_00fb20eee1c75140016a82152db568819883c4980108836877","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The expert review is complete with no actionable findings. The key invariants hold together:\n\n- a same-position mapping with an active destination necessarily has a historical source because the partial index permits only one active leg;\n- direct delete, delete-and-reinsert, leg deletion, and whole-booking cascade are distinguished correctly at deferred constraint time;\n- every production relation read that represents the current itinerary filters superseded legs, with a helper-level fallback;\n- payment identity, booking reference, original charged total, released old seat, and live replacement seat remain intact.\n\nThe optional `/code-review` plugin is not installed here, so this was the repository-prescribed main-agent expert review. I’m committing the reviewed state next, then I’ll open the PR and watch its checks."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1786909997764,"completed_at_ms":1786910000719}}
